+
+## Notes
+
+- The ingested Majid source routes to poultry/chicken because the measured matrix is broiler breast and thigh meat. The auto-fetch filename was cumin/Ni, but cumin is the feed intervention, not the occurrence matrix.
+- The page commit was blocked once by the wiki edit audit pre-commit hook; a concurrent local automation commit then included the Majid page and trace-file updates. Codex pushed that commit to preserve the completed page.
