+# STOPPED EARLY - single page took long
+
+- Snapshot file: `/tmp/codex-snapshot-1780397651.txt`
+- Snapshot count at fire-start: 129 PDFs
+- First command output note: `3288 total` was the aggregate across older `/tmp/codex-snapshot-*.txt` files already present, not the single current snapshot.
+- Final auto-fetched depth: 134 PDFs
+
+## Breakdown
+
+- Real ingests: 1
+- Dedup rollups: 1
+- Skips: 4
+- Escalations: 0
+
+## Commits
+
+- `f207a97` - `triage sweep 2026-06-02 10:55: 1 rollups + 0 skips`
+  - Dedup-rollup: `auto-whitening-products-cd-product_2024_10-33003-fjs-2024-0803-2500.pdf` -> existing `oviri2024-nigeria-bathing-soaps-metals`.
