+- `ing-cumin-ni_2024_10-32894-medip-24-1-5.pdf` - `skip:not-food-occurrence`; black cumin foliar nickel/copper agronomy experiment, not finished food occurrence.
+- `ing-cumin-pb_2023_10-3389-fonc-2023-1322875.pdf` - `skip:no-heavy-metal-data`; cumin seed extract anticancer/cell-line study.
+- `ing-cumin-pb_2025_10-62476-abes-102190.pdf` - `skip:not-food-occurrence`; pharmaceutical effluent remediation using cumin residue adsorbents.
+- `ing-cumin-pb_2025_10-66660-ghyn-v1i4-89.pdf` - `skip:incomplete-metadata`; spice occurrence paper has primary Pb/Hg data, but the PDF text lacks DOI field and usable English author attribution required by this fire contract.
